OL,3,GNEWSAMen held in major incident near
OL,4,ARAF Fairford as homes evacuated
OL,5,
OL,6,FUK counter-terrorism police are leading
OL,7,Fan investigation in which several men
OL,8,Fwere arrested on suspicion of
OL,9,Fexplosives offences near an RAF station
OL,10,Fwhich hosts the United States Air Force
OL,11,F(USAF).
OL,13,FAn Army explosive ordnance disposal
OL,14,Fteam has been examining vehicles near
OL,15,FRAF Fairford in Gloucestershire and
OL,16,Fhomes in the nearby village of Whelford
OL,17,Fhave been evacuated while
OL,18,Finvestigations continue, police said.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
